 tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Popis aplikace<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >FT-IR spektroskopie<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p>Z\u00a0hlediska bezpe\u010dnosti a obrany je naprosto z\u00e1sadn\u00ed m\u00edt rychlou a spolehlivou techniku, kter\u00e1 dok\u00e1\u017ee analyzovat potenci\u00e1ln\u011b nebezpe\u010dn\u00e9 chemik\u00e1lie v\u010detn\u011b plynn\u00fdch vzork\u016f. Z\u00a0toho d\u016fvodu je <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/ftir-spektroskopie\/\"><strong>FT-IR spektroskopie<\/strong><\/a> v\u00edce ne\u017e vhodn\u00e1, proto\u017ee je to nejen vysoce specifick\u00e1 metoda (ka\u017ed\u00e1 l\u00e1tka m\u00e1 sv\u00e9 unik\u00e1tn\u00ed spektrum), ale dok\u00e1\u017ee tak\u00e9 pod\u00e1vat informace o funk\u010dn\u00edch skupin\u00e1ch. Nav\u00edc je mo\u017en\u00e9 ji spojit i s\u00a0dal\u0161\u00edmi technikami: nap\u0159. s\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ftir-gc\/\"><strong>plynovou chromatografi\u00ed (GC)<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_9609\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9609\" style=\"width: 600px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9609\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/d8edd7e7-300x296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"591\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/d8edd7e7-300x296.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/d8edd7e7-1024x1009.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/d8edd7e7-768x757.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/d8edd7e7.png 1082w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9609\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Sch\u00e9ma propojen\u00ed FT-IR spektroskopie a plynov\u00e9 chromatografie (GC)<\/figcaption><\/figure><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Ka\u017ed\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstroj je vybaven spektr\u00e1ln\u00edmi knihovnami s\u00a0des\u00edtkami tis\u00edc spekter r\u016fzn\u00fdch l\u00e1tek, a tak sta\u010d\u00ed spektrum zm\u011b\u0159it a vyhled\u00e1vac\u00ed algoritmus s\u00e1m nam\u011b\u0159en\u00e9 spektrum identifikuje a informuje v\u00e1s o jeho nebezpe\u010dnosti, a to b\u011bhem pouh\u00fdch n\u011bkolika okam\u017eik\u016f. Z\u00edsk\u00e1te tak nejen p\u0159esn\u00fd a spolehliv\u00fd v\u00fdsledek, ale tak\u00e9 \u010das, kter\u00fd m\u016f\u017ee zachr\u00e1nit \u017eivoty.<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_9611\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9611\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9611\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/95e5245e-300x213.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"355\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/95e5245e-300x213.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/95e5245e-1024x727.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/95e5245e-768x545.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/95e5245e.png 1467w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9611\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">FT-IR spektrum bojov\u00e9ho plynu GA s v\u00fdrazn\u00fdm p\u00e1sem okolo 2200 cm<sup>-1<\/sup>, kter\u00fd je typick\u00fd pro kyanidy<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure id=\"attachment_9613\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9613\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9613\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/7b02de6e-300x222.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"369\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/7b02de6e-300x222.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/7b02de6e-1024x757.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/7b02de6e-768x567.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/7b02de6e.png 1409w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9613\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">FT-IR spektrum bojov\u00e9ho plynu, kter\u00fd obsahuje pinacoylovou skupinu, a tak vykazuje v\u00fdrazn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed p\u00e1sy v oblasti valen\u010dn\u00edch vibrac\u00ed (okolo 3000 cm<sup>-1<\/sup>)<\/figcaption><\/figure>                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 15px 0px;}}<\/style>\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"section\" data-elementor-id=\"5032\" class=\"elementor elementor-5032\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-secti